WEBVTT

00:00:56.562 --> 00:01:00.277
Later, I broached the subject
with his father,

00:01:00.301 --> 00:01:03.388
and it turned out to be
a mighty touchy affair.

00:01:04.793 --> 00:01:06.831
He said things like,

00:01:06.855 --> 00:01:10.190
"Oh, only this son of mine
likes to eat it.

00:01:10.214 --> 00:01:13.084
We tell him, 'Give it up. It's bad.'

00:01:13.108 --> 00:01:14.978
He doesn't listen, you see.

00:01:15.002 --> 00:01:18.275
We gave up eating all this ages back."

00:01:19.763 --> 00:01:21.831
"Why?" I asked.

00:01:22.752 --> 00:01:25.126
"This is your traditional food.

00:01:26.108 --> 00:01:28.700
It is available in your environment,

00:01:28.724 --> 00:01:30.170
it is nutritious,